        "@value": "Documentation event that recorded this (pre-existing) entity or event. Uses heritageGraph:documentedBy (aligned to prov:wasInfluencedBy). NOTE: prov:wasGeneratedBy was incorrect: a stupa is not *generated by* the survey that records it."
